_name_jianti_auto":"济阴王","people_xingming":"刘长","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"95183985-db0e-11ef-a407-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":40,"link_death_year":79,"link_td_description":"明德皇后，伏波将军马援小女，母蔺氏，名不详，汉明帝刘庄的皇后，撰《显宗起居注》。","link_td_id":"Q10001122","link_td_number_id":501420,"people_name":"馬后","people_name_jianti_auto":"马后","people_xingming":"马皇后","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"95183986-db0e-11ef-9d89-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"95183971-db0e-11ef-a51a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"bǐng","source_anchor_text":"為汝南王昞為常山王","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":28,"text":"昞","tongjian_id":"573138bb-ce5e-51d3-87f0-ef12fa6a0cd8"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":153,"start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"95183987-db0e-11ef-bcb2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮阳","resolved_place_entity_id":723,"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"95183988-db0e-11ef-8639-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2封皇子恭爲鉅鹿王，黨爲樂成王，衍爲下邳王，暢爲汝南王，昞爲常山王，長爲濟陰王；帝親定其封域，裁令半楚、淮陽。馬后曰：「諸子數縣，於制不亦儉乎？」帝曰：「我子豈宜與先帝子等，歲給二千萬足矣！」","content_fanyi":"封皇子刘恭为巨鹿王，刘党为乐成王，刘衍为下邳王，刘畅为汝南王，刘昞为常山王，刘长为济阴王；汉明帝亲自裁定各王封域，下令封土总额仅及旧楚国、淮阳国封地的一半。马皇后说：“诸皇子封域只有几个县，按定制来说不也太少了吗？”明帝说：“我的儿子怎么可以与先帝的儿子相等？每年给二千万钱就足够了！”","content_jianti_auto":"2封皇子恭为巨鹿王，党为乐成王，衍为下邳王，畅为汝南王，昞为常山王，长为济阴王；帝亲定其封域，裁令半楚、淮阳。马后曰：「诸子数县，于制不亦俭乎？」帝曰：「我子岂宜与先帝子等，岁给二千万足矣！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3602,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95183971-db0e-11ef-a51a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3乙巳，赦天下。","content_fanyi":"四月初十日乙巳，大赦天下。","content_jianti_auto":"3乙巳，赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3603,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95183989-db0e-11ef-869d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"百官志：謁者僕射，秩比千石，爲謁者臺率，主謁者。古重習武，有主射以督錄之，故曰僕射。數，所角翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"百官志：谒者仆射，秩比千石，为谒者台率，主谒者。古重习武，有主射以督录之，故曰仆射。数，所角翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9518398b-db0e-11ef-ac7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爾雅曰：父之昆弟，先生爲世父，後生爲叔父。","note_content_jianti_auto":"尔雅曰：父之昆弟，先生为世父，后生为叔父。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"9518398d-db0e-11ef-922c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95183991-db0e-11ef-876a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95183992-db0e-11ef-8b94-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"縯","people_name_jianti_auto":"𬙂","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"95183993-db0e-11ef-8fd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"張，齊王縯之孫。","note_content_jianti_auto":"张，齐王𬙂之孙。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"95183990-db0e-11ef-9a16-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"95183997-db0e-11ef-815a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"95183998-db0e-11ef-a039-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"居延","place_name_jianti_auto":"居延","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95183999-db0e-11ef-bfdf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"張掖郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"张掖郡","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9518399a-db0e-11ef-a4bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"甘州","place_name_jianti_auto":"甘州","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"9518399b-db0e-11ef-b0e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"張掖縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"张掖县","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"9518399c-db0e-11ef-8fd8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"居延，武帝置縣，屬張掖郡。賢曰：故城在今甘州張掖縣北。","note_content_jianti_auto":"居延，武帝置县，属张掖郡。贤曰：故城在今甘州张掖县北。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"95183996-db0e-11ef-b1f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"白山","place_name_jianti_auto":"白山","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"951839a0-db0e-11ef-843f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白山","place_name_jianti_auto":"白山","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"951839a1-db0e-11ef-b49f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"951839a2-db0e-11ef-8e22-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"天山","place_name_jianti_auto":"天山","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"951839a3-db0e-11ef-b4fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲類海","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲类海","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"951839a4-db0e-11ef-ba85-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"西河舊事曰：白山冬夏有雪，故曰白山，匈奴謂之天山，過之，皆下馬拜焉，去蒲類海百里之內。","note_content_jianti_auto":"西河旧事曰：白山冬夏有雪，故曰白山，匈奴谓之天山，过之，皆下马拜焉，去蒲类海百里之内。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":194,"tongjian_id":"9518399f-db0e-11ef-9487-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"951839a7-db0e-11ef-8ea9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"951839a8-db0e-11ef-96bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊吾盧","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾卢","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"951839a9-db0e-11ef-a0c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"951839aa-db0e-11ef-b4c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宜禾","place_name_jianti_auto":"宜禾","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"951839ab-db0e-11ef-b77e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊州","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"951839ac-db0e-11ef-8619-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"納職縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"纳职县","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"951839ad-db0e-11ef-9f18-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"951839ae-db0e-11ef-85fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"951839af-db0e-11ef-acbc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"瓜州","place_name_jianti_auto":"瓜州","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"951839b0-db0e-11ef-b185-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋昌县","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"951839b1-db0e-11ef-92c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：伊吾卽伊吾盧地，本屬匈奴，後取其地置宜禾都尉，以爲屯田，今伊州納職縣伊吾故城是也。又曰：伊吾故城，在今瓜州晉昌縣北。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：伊吾即伊吾卢地，本属匈奴，后取其地置宜禾都尉，以为屯田，今伊州纳职县伊吾故城是也。又曰：伊吾故城，在今瓜州晋昌县北。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":198,"tongjian_id":"951839a6-db0e-11ef-bc17-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"951839b5-db0e-11ef-a87a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"951839b6-db0e-11ef-96d6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"三都尉皆武帝置，奉車都尉掌乘輿，駙馬都尉掌天子之副馬。師古曰：駙，副也；一曰，近也，疾也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"三都尉皆武帝置，奉车都尉掌乘舆，驸马都尉掌天子之副马。师古曰：驸，副也；一曰，近也，疾也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":314,"tongjian_id":"951839b4-db0e-11ef-aef2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"謁者僕射","official_note":"謁者僕射是汉代官职，掌管宫廷礼仪和传达诏命，属于光禄勋下属。在上下文中，耿秉以此官职身份多次上书建议攻打匈奴，显示其参与朝政讨论。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"謁者僕射耿秉數上言請擊匈奴","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"63b441c3-aa04-45bf-96a1-23177910a7fc"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"太僕","official_note":"太僕是汉代九卿之一，掌管皇帝车马和宫廷马政。在上下文中，祭肜以太僕身份参与军事会议，讨论匈奴策略。","official_rank":"九卿之一","source_snippet":"乃使秉、固與太僕祭肜、虎賁中郞將馬廖、下博侯劉張、好畤侯耿忠等共議之","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"88d964e1-4165-43e2-92c1-b1d5d2dda3ea"},{"confidence":0.88,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"虎賁中郞將","official_note":"虎賁中郞将是汉代禁军将领，负责宫廷侍卫和军事事务。在上下文中，马廖以此官职参与军事会议，显示其军事角色。","official_rank":"中郞將级别","source_snippet":"乃使秉、固與太僕祭肜、虎賁中郞將馬廖、下博侯劉張、好畤侯耿忠等共議之","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"7da22ce0-018a-4f45-9d55-79015e961957"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"駙馬都尉","official_note":"駙馬都尉是汉代官职，原为掌管副车马匹，后常授予皇帝女婿或亲信，成为荣誉性职务。在上下文中，耿秉被任命为此职，可能表示其受皇帝信任参与军事行动。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"十二月，以秉爲駙馬都尉","start_index":290,"tongjian_id":"bc55df3d-5e07-4925-ac1b-b2ea61722d7f"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"奉車都尉","official_note":"奉車都尉是汉代官职，掌管皇帝车驾，属于亲近侍从。在上下文中，竇固被任命为此职，可能与其参与军事行动有关。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"固爲奉車都尉","start_index":299,"tongjian_id":"342af158-6757-42ab-8093-f0aa1982304c"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"騎都尉","official_note":"騎都尉是汉代军事官职，掌管骑兵，常参与征战。在上下文中，秦彭以此官职担任耿秉的副手，显示其在军事行动中的角色。","official_rank":"都尉级别","source_snippet":"以騎都尉秦彭爲秉副","start_index":307,"tongjian_id":"2811164a-11a8-4455-8ca2-05112b527c9f"},{"confidence":0.75,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"從事","official_note":"從事是汉代官职，常作为将军或地方官的属官，协助处理事务。在上下文中，设置從事可能用于辅助军事行动的管理。","official_rank":"低级属官","source_snippet":"皆置從事、司馬","start_index":320,"tongjian_id":"2f4331c6-56d3-4b90-aaea-66b49e15e3c1"},{"confidence":0.75,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"司馬","official_note":"司馬是汉代军事官职，掌管军队行政和纪律，常作为将军的副手。在上下文中，设置司馬可能用于加强军事组织的管理。","official_rank":"中级军官","source_snippet":"皆置從事、司馬","start_index":323,"tongjian_id":"cfa2e1f8-0ace-4181-9749-ff9adda9836a"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":91,"link_td_description":"耿秉，字伯初，扶风茂陵人。东汉名将，美阳侯，谥号桓侯。","link_td_id":"Q10007343","link_td_number_id":3510295,"people_name":"耿秉","people_name_jianti_auto":"耿秉","people_xingming":"耿秉","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"951839b7-db0e-11ef-84f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":88,"link_td_description":"窦固，字孟孙，扶风平陵（今陕西咸阳西北）人，窦融弟窦友之子，娶光武帝女涅阳公主。","link_td_id":"Q10000612","link_td_number_id":325821,"people_name":"顯親侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"显亲侯","people_xingming":"窦固","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"951839b9-db0e-11ef-930d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":88,"link_td_description":"窦固，字孟孙，扶风平陵（今陕西咸阳西北）人，窦融弟窦友之子，娶光武帝女涅阳公主。","link_td_id":"Q10000612","link_td_number_id":325821,"people_name":"竇固","people_name_jianti_auto":"窦固","people_xingming":"窦固","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"951839ba-db0e-11ef-9692-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-16,"link_death_year":62,"link_td_description":"窦融，字周公，扶风平陵（今陕西省咸阳市